	(text "IMU (U601, U602): motion sensor and magnetometer, plus the I2C pull-ups"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7fe6518b-1d49-5e5e-a3be-6da7d039b2f7")
	)
	(text_box "WHAT IT DOES\nU601 (MPU-6500) measures acceleration and rotation; U602 (LIS3MDL) measures the magnetic field (compass heading).\nThe ESP32 reads both over I2C: U601 at address 0x69, U602 at 0x1E. U601 signals new data on IMU_INT.\nR211/R212 are the pull-ups of the whole I2C bus (RTC, EEPROM, ADC, GPS and Qwiic share it); they sit here on the PCB.\n\nPINS OF THIS MODULE (its block on the top sheet)\n+3V3 (in): supply from the 3.3 V regulator (ESP32 + USB module)\nGND: ground\nI2C_SCL, I2C_SDA (both ways): the shared I2C bus to the ESP32 (GPIO22 = SCL, GPIO21 = SDA)\nIMU_INT (out): U601 interrupt to ESP32 GPIO39\nPower and ground reach the parts on this sheet only through these pins: the ground and supply symbols drawn on this sheet are local to it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 17.78 0)
		(size 388 26.55)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1d3c842a-8322-5b86-b83a-950cbbf07423")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 157.48 78.74)
		(end 236.22 165.1)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type dash)
			(color 200 60 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "a132940c-7e1d-5d6b-bb99-7da84851832b")
	)
	(text "keep together on the PCB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 158.08 79.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "04ab35d8-b478-5280-9714-e8239ef6ab86")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 279.4 88.9)
		(end 335.28 154.94)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type dash)
			(color 200 60 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "c9d8a3e4-ca3c-5e9d-a85b-d6794d5fac1c")
	)
	(text "keep together on the PCB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 280 89.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "611ecdc1-70b4-56a3-9c8b-76bb94df43f2")
	)
	(text "Each capacitor belongs to ONE pin of U601. On the PCB put it within 2 mm\nof that pin, with a short track and a GND via right beside its GND pad:\n  C602 10 nF  -> pin 8  (VDDIO)\n  C601 100 nF -> pin 13 (VDD)\n  C603 100 nF -> pin 10 (REGOUT, filter of the chip's own regulator)\nKeep tracks and vias out from under the chip (keep-out areas on the PCB)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7b90e342-fe8c-59e3-9b15-631426cacb1c")
	)
	(text "Each capacitor belongs to ONE pin of U602 (within 2 mm, GND via at its pad):\n  C604 1 uF   -> pin 5 (Vdd)\n  C605 100 nF -> pin 6 (Vdd_IO)\n  C606 100 nF -> pin 4 (C1, used inside the chip)\nKeep U602 20 mm or more from L101/U101 (5V buck), BT401 (coin cell)\nand J1: magnetic parts and big currents disturb the compass."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.4 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c70feef7-e6cc-5931-9493-ac5332428c4a")
	)
	(text "Bus pull-ups: one pair\nfor the whole I2C bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.52 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "15ac30aa-868f-59d6-97de-e8bd84c5c20d")
	)
	(text "Turn U601 and U602 the same way on the PCB. The firmware reads both chips' axes as if they point\nthe same way across the board; turning a chip changes which way its X and Y point, and the firmware's\naxis mapping must then change with it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "18bd5c99-28d0-5609-ace8-6e72a6d6bf2e")
	)
	(text_box "PARTS AND THEIR JOBS\nU601: MPU-6500 accelerometer + gyroscope (QFN-24). AD0 = 3V3 sets address 0x69 (0x68 is the RTC). nCS = 3V3 selects I2C. FSYNC and RESV pin 20 to GND, NC pins open.\nC601: 100 nF decoupling for U601 VDD (pin 13).\nC602: 10 nF decoupling for U601 VDDIO (pin 8).\nC603: 100 nF filter for U601 REGOUT (pin 10): the output of a small regulator inside the MPU-6500. Not on +3V3.\nU602: LIS3MDL magnetometer (LGA-12). SA1 = 3V3 sets address 0x1E; CS = 3V3 selects I2C. INT and DRDY are not used.\nC604: 1 uF decoupling for U602 Vdd (pin 5).\nC605: 100 nF decoupling for U602 Vdd_IO (pin 6).\nC606: 100 nF on U602 pin C1 (4), needed by a circuit inside the chip. Not on +3V3.\nR211, R212: 4.7k pull-ups for I2C_SDA and I2C_SCL. I2C lines are open drain: every chip only pulls them low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 222 0)
		(size 280 24.5)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6c4ec4a4-457a-5277-bb6d-dc981fa96e50")
	)
